flowchart TB
  %% =========================
  %% USERS + FRONTEND
  %% =========================
  U[Recruiter / Visitor<br/>(Desktop & Mobile)] -->|Opens portfolio site| P[Portfolio Website<br/>(GitHub Pages / Custom Domain)]
  P --> W[Ajmal AI Widget (widget.js + widget.css)<br/>Modern Chat UI Embedded in Portfolio]

  %% Chat UX
  W -->|Typed message| FE_CHAT[Frontend Chat Flow]
  FE_CHAT -->|POST /chat (JSON)| API_CHAT

  %% Voice UX (Siri-style session)
  W -->|Mic click| FE_VOICE[Frontend Voice Session Loop]
  FE_VOICE -->|Mic permission (getUserMedia)| MIC[(Browser Microphone)]
  FE_VOICE -->|SpeechRecognition<br/>(webkitSpeechRecognition)| STT[Browser STT Engine]
  STT -->|Transcript| FE_VOICE
  FE_VOICE -->|POST /chat| API_CHAT
  FE_VOICE -->|POST /tts| API_TTS
  API_TTS -->|base64 audio/mpeg| FE_VOICE
  FE_VOICE -->|Play audio| SPK[(Device Speaker)]
  FE_VOICE -->|Overlay status: Listening / Thinking / Speaking| OVERLAY[Siri-style Voice Overlay UI]

  %% =========================
  %% BACKEND (FASTAPI)
  %% =========================
  subgraph B[Backend API (FastAPI on Railway)]
    API_CHAT[POST /chat<br/>Answer + Sources]:::api
    API_TTS[POST /tts<br/>Returns base64 audio]:::api
    API_HEALTH[GET /health<br/>Service status]:::api
    CORS[CORS Middleware<br/>Allow GitHub Pages + ajmalamir.com]:::svc
  end

  W -->|Health check (optional)| API_HEALTH

  %% =========================
  %% RAG + LLM PIPELINE
  %% =========================
  API_CHAT -->|1) Retrieve relevant context| RAG[RAGStore<br/>FAISS Search + Chunk Loader]:::svc
  RAG -->|Embed query| EMB[OpenAI Embeddings API<br/>text-embedding-3-small]:::ext
  EMB -->|Query vector| RAG
  RAG -->|Top-K matching chunks| CTX[Context Builder<br/>Sources + Snippets]:::svc

  API_CHAT -->|2) Generate answer using context| LLM[OpenAI Chat Completions<br/>gpt-4o-mini]:::ext
  CTX --> LLM
  LLM -->|Answer text| API_CHAT

  %% Link fallback
  API_CHAT -->|If question is "LinkedIn/GitHub/Portfolio link"| FALLBACK[Link Fallback Extractor<br/>(Regex over links.md chunk)]:::svc
  FALLBACK --> API_CHAT

  %% =========================
  %% TTS PIPELINE
  %% =========================
  API_TTS -->|Text to Speech| EL[ElevenLabs TTS API<br/>Cloned Voice ID]:::ext
  EL -->|MP3 bytes| API_TTS

  %% =========================
  %% KNOWLEDGE BASE + INGESTION
  %% =========================
  subgraph K[Knowledge Base + Ingestion]
    DOCS[Knowledge Files<br/>resume.pdf, about.md, projects.md, links.md]:::data
    ING[ingest.py<br/>Chunking + Embeddings + Index Build]:::svc
    STORE[(storage/<br/>index.faiss + chunks.json)]:::data
  end

  DOCS --> ING
  ING -->|Build vectors + metadata| STORE
  STORE -->|Loaded at API startup| RAG

